  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.1\n\n            - Added NormalizeCompat for CJK Compatibility Ideographs and NormalizeCompatExtended for curated extended compatibility mappings.\n            - Added NormalizeUnicodeCompat for curated Unicode compatibility and variant forms alone; requires native v0.9.0.0 with the corresponding export.\n            - Added DeTofu and DeTofuLevel with inclusive Extension B through I display fallback thresholds; unmapped characters are preserved.\n            - Transforms are optional: normalize before conversion and apply DeTofu afterward. Existing conversion behavior is unchanged.\n            - Added Unicode/NUL and level validation, synchronized disposal protection, and regression coverage.\n            - Expanded XML documentation for native APIs, ownership, failure results, and transform contracts.\n            - Original transform APIs require native v0.8.1 or later. Packaged native binaries updated to v0.9.0.0; Windows x64 tested, Linux/macOS execution validation pending.",
